---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Services | Good Mess Learning" active="services">
<header style="position:relative;padding:56px 56px 88px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;right:80px;top:60px;transform:rotate(-10deg);background:#FF6B35;color:#1A1220;width:124px;height:124px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;line-height:1.05">mix &amp;<br>match</div>
<div style="position:relative;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B8246F">Services</div>
<h1 style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:820px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,92px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#1A1220;text-wrap:balance">Support for every <em style="color:#E8359A">kind</em> of learner.</h1>
<p style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:620px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;text-wrap:pretty">Classes, tutoring, planning, and coaching, mixed and matched to fit your family. In person in Clermont / Lake County, FL. Virtual anywhere.</p>
</header><div style="padding:0 56px 72px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:-40px"><a href="#learners" style="text-decoration:none;background:#FCE8F2;color:#1A1220;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px" data-h="9">For learners</a><a href="#families" style="text-decoration:none;background:#FFF8DC;color:#1A1220;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px" data-h="9">For families</a><a href="#schools" style="text-decoration:none;background:#E3FBF8;color:#1A1220;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px" data-h="9">For schools &amp; co-ops</a></div>
<section id="learners" style="padding:0 56px 112px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;scroll-margin-top:24px">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;">For learners</h2><p style="margin:0;max-width:440px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Hands-on instruction for homeschoolers, and support beyond the school day for public and private school kids.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,270px),1fr));gap:28px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #E8359A;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#E8359A">01</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">1:1 tutoring</h3><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><p style="margin:0">Focused, one-on-one sessions for a subject, a skill, or a gap, tailored to exactly where your learner is. Reading &amp; phonics, ELA, math, science, history, and geography.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px"><strong style="color:#1A1220">Format:</strong> in person or virtual</p></div><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #CFC3CC;display:flex"><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700">Ask about it →</a></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #FF6B35;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#FF6B35">02</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Small-group classes</h3><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><p style="margin:0">Project-based, discussion-driven groups of 3–8 organized by subject, designed to be all your learner needs for that subject.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px"><strong style="color:#1A1220">Format:</strong> in person or live online</p></div><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #CFC3CC;display:flex"><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700">Ask about it →</a></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #FFD23F;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#C9A000">03</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Enrichment for public &amp; private school kids</h3><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><p style="margin:0">After-school and weekend clubs, PBL units, and writing workshops that follow your learner’s curiosity and build real-life skills.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px"><strong style="color:#1A1220">Format:</strong> in person, live online, or self-paced</p></div><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #CFC3CC;display:flex"><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700">Ask about it →</a></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #0BBFB0;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;color:#089A8E">04</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Learning assessments</h3><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><p style="margin:0">A friendly, hands-on look at where your learner is in reading, writing, and math, with a written summary and next steps you can act on.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px"><strong style="color:#1A1220">Format:</strong> in person or virtual</p></div><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #CFC3CC;display:flex"><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700">Ask about it →</a></div></div>
</div>
</section>
<div id="families" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><section style="background:#3E2F50;padding:96px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><div style="position:absolute;right:-160px;top:-160px;width:480px;height:480px;border-radius:50%;background:#652F63"></div><div style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:720px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFD23F">Choice Navigator</div><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;color:#FDFAF6">For families</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#E9E2EC">You don't have to figure it out alone. Get a FL-certified teacher and an experienced homeschool mom and coach in your corner.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:28px;align-items:start">
<div style="transform:rotate(-1.2deg);margin-top:0px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #E8359A" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Homeschool consulting</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">New to homeschooling, or switching approaches? A full onboarding session or an annual kickoff to set the year up right.</p><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px">Ask about it →</a></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(1deg);margin-top:24px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #FFD23F" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Curriculum planning &amp; personalized learning plans</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Scope and sequence, curriculum picks, and resource lists built around your learner, with async email support along the way.</p><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px">Ask about it →</a></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(-0.6deg);margin-top:8px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #0BBFB0" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Parent coaching</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">A sounding board when you feel stuck mid-year, or need a plan that fits your family instead of someone else’s.</p><a href="/contact/" style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px">Ask about it →</a></div>
</div></div></section></div>
<section id="schools" style="padding:112px 56px;scroll-margin-top:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:3px solid #1A1220;border-radius:28px;box-shadow:10px 10px 0 #0BBFB0;padding:56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;">For schools &amp; co-ops</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E">Hands-on workshops and class series for your group, built around your goals and the learners in the room.</p><a href="/contact/" style="align-self:flex-start;background:#E8359A;color:#FDFAF6;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700" data-h="10">Request a workshop</a></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8359A;margin-top:7px"></span><div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A1220">Project-based learning units</div><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">A multi-week, interdisciplinary project your learners own from question to showcase.</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF6B35;margin-top:7px"></span><div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A1220">Co-op class series</div><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Recurring small-group classes delivered on site, any subject.</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F;margin-top:7px"></span><div><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A1220">Parent &amp; teacher workshops</div><div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Practical sessions on hands-on, personalized learning you can use Monday.</div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:0 56px 96px">
<div style="background:#E8359A;border-radius:40px;padding:72px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
<div style="position:absolute;right:220px;bottom:-90px;width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F"></div>
<h2 style="position:relative;margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:56px;line-height:1;color:#FDFAF6;max-width:640px">Not sure where to start? Let's map it out together.</h2>
<a href="/contact/" style="position:relative;background:#1A1220;color:#FDFAF6;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 32px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap" data-h="8">Book a free intro call</a>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
